Z||000000||Kasdan||10-23-2001||05:10 PM||||Ok, ive had the car back with the new (rebuilt) motor for about 2 days.  Ive been hearing a clicking sound under light throttle.  And i also seem to have a slight power loss, but then again im babying the new motor a little for a while, and advice?  suggestions?  whats the sound?<P>------------------<BR>Tyler Morgan, 1986 GT<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero21.jpg">           <BR>Aftermarket Power Steering<BR>Aim=FieroDriver1986||||reg||1
