Z||000005||88CoupeV6||10-23-2001||05:48 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Kasdan:<BR><B>Wouldnt an exhaust leak be noticible at idle though?  Raydar, how far are you from me?  in in Athens.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Not always. I have one on my GT and it only makes the noise on light acceleration.<BR>||||reg||1
